  before running anything.
</p>

<h2>What happened</h2>
<p>
  The result, with the numbers, the sample size, and the evaluation window.
</p>

<h2>Diagnosis</h2>
<p>
  Why. This is the section a hiring manager actually reads — it is the one that
  cannot be faked by a good backtest.
</p>

<h2>What changed as a result</h2>
